{"seq":3,"slug":"code-generation","title":"代码生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/migration-and-scale/code-generation","wordCount":666,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"代码生成\">代码生成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>代码生成</strong>把&quot;创建新包&quot;这一多步骤、易出错的过程变成自动化、标准化的流程：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>代表工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>脚手架</td>\n<td>通过模板生成符合约定的文件集合</td>\n<td>Plop、Hygen、Turbo Gen</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互式问答</td>\n<td>收集配置以驱动模板变量</td>\n<td>generator prompts</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后置自动化</td>\n<td>生成后执行安装、构建、类型检查</td>\n<td>post-generate 脚本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键在于<strong>模板承载团队约定</strong>：目录结构、<code>package.json</code> 字段、<code>tsconfig.json</code>、测试配置等标准内容由模板一次固化。工具选择（Plop 灵活定制 / Hygen 零配置 / Turbo Gen 内置）并不重要，重要的是&quot;所有新包都必须通过脚手架创建&quot;——一旦允许手动创建，约定就会逐渐被遗忘，一致性随之瓦解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码生成在-monorepo-中的价值\">代码生成在 Monorepo 中的价值</h2><p>在 Monorepo 中创建一个新包需要遵循一系列约定：目录结构、package.json 的标准字段、tsconfig.json 的正确配置、ESLint 和 Vitest 的初始化……手动完成这些步骤既繁琐又容易出错。<strong>代码生成</strong>（Code Generation）通过模板和脚手架工具将&quot;创建新包&quot;变成一个自动化、标准化的过程，确保每个新包都符合团队约定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    DEV[开发者] --&gt;|pnpm generate| CLI[脚手架 CLI]&#10;    CLI --&gt;|交互式问答| CONFIG[收集配置]&#10;    CONFIG --&gt;|套用模板| FILES[生成文件]&#10;    FILES --&gt; PKG[package.json]&#10;    FILES --&gt; TSC[tsconfig.json]&#10;    FILES --&gt; SRC[src/index.ts]&#10;    FILES --&gt; TEST[vitest.config.ts]\">flowchart LR\n    DEV[开发者] --&gt;|pnpm generate| CLI[脚手架 CLI]\n    CLI --&gt;|交互式问答| CONFIG[收集配置]\n    CONFIG --&gt;|套用模板| FILES[生成文件]\n    FILES --&gt; PKG[package.json]\n    FILES --&gt; TSC[tsconfig.json]\n    FILES --&gt; SRC[src/index.ts]\n    FILES --&gt; TEST[vitest.config.ts]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"plop-脚手架\">Plop 脚手架</h2><p><strong>Plop</strong> 是一个轻量级的代码生成工具，通过定义 generator 和 Handlebars 模板来创建文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// plopfile.ts&#10;import type { NodePlopAPI } from &#39;plop&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default function (plop: NodePlopAPI): void {&#10;  plop.setGenerator(&#39;package&#39;, {&#10;    description: &#39;Create a new shared package&#39;,&#10;    prompts: [&#10;      {&#10;        type: &#39;input&#39;,&#10;        name: &#39;name&#39;,&#10;        message: &#39;Package name (without scope):&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        type: &#39;list&#39;,&#10;        name: &#39;type&#39;,&#10;        message: &#39;Package type:&#39;,&#10;        choices: [&#39;library&#39;, &#39;config&#39;, &#39;types&#39;],&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        type: &#39;confirm&#39;,&#10;        name: &#39;hasReact&#39;,&#10;        message: &#39;Does this package use React?&#39;,&#10;        default: false,&#10;      },&#10;    ],&#10;    actions: [&#10;      {&#10;        type: &#39;add&#39;,&#10;        path: &#39;packages/{{name}}/package.json&#39;,&#10;        templateFile: &#39;templates/package/package.json.hbs&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        type: &#39;add&#39;,&#10;        path: &#39;packages/{{name}}/tsconfig.json&#39;,&#10;        templateFile: &#39;templates/package/tsconfig.json.hbs&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        type: &#39;add&#39;,&#10;        path: &#39;packages/{{name}}/src/index.ts&#39;,&#10;        templateFile: &#39;templates/package/index.ts.hbs&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        type: &#39;add&#39;,&#10;        path: &#39;packages/{{name}}/vitest.config.ts&#39;,&#10;        templateFile: &#39;templates/package/vitest.config.ts.hbs&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;    ],&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// plopfile.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { NodePlopAPI } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'plop'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">plop</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NodePlopAPI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plop.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setGenerator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'package'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Create a new shared package'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prompts: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'input'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'name'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Package name (without scope):'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'list'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Package type:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        choices: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'library'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'config'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'types'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'confirm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hasReact'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Does this package use React?'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        default: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    actions: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'add'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/{{name}}/package.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        templateFile: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'templates/package/package.json.hbs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'add'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/{{name}}/tsconfig.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        templateFile: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'templates/package/tsconfig.json.hbs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'add'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/{{name}}/src/index.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        templateFile: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'templates/package/index.ts.hbs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'add'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/{{name}}/vitest.config.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        templateFile: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'templates/package/vitest.config.ts.hbs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"plop-模板文件\">Plop 模板文件</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"handlebars\" data-code=\"{{! templates/package/package.json.hbs }}&#10;{ &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/{{name}}&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;0.1.0&quot;, &quot;private&quot;: false, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;module&quot;, &quot;exports&quot;: { &quot;.&quot;: { &quot;types&quot;:&#10;&quot;./src/index.ts&quot;, &quot;default&quot;: &quot;./src/index.ts&quot; } }, &quot;scripts&quot;: { &quot;build&quot;: &quot;tsup&quot;, &quot;dev&quot;: &quot;tsup --watch&quot;, &quot;test&quot;: &quot;vitest&#10;run&quot;, &quot;typecheck&quot;: &quot;tsc --noEmit&quot;, &quot;lint&quot;: &quot;eslint .&quot; },&#10;{{#if hasReact}}&#10;  &quot;peerDependencies&quot;: { &quot;react&quot;: &quot;^18.0.0&quot; },&#10;{{/if}}&#10;&quot;devDependencies&quot;: { &quot;@myorg/tsconfig&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;, &quot;@myorg/eslint-config&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;,&#10;{{#if hasReact}}&#10;  &quot;react&quot;: &quot;^18.3.0&quot;,&#10;{{/if}}&#10;&quot;tsup&quot;: &quot;^8.0.0&quot;, &quot;typescript&quot;: &quot;^5.7.0&quot;, &quot;vitest&quot;: &quot;^3.0.0&quot; } }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{{! templates/package/package.json.hbs }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ \"name\": \"@myorg/{{name}}\", \"version\": \"0.1.0\", \"private\": false, \"type\": \"module\", \"exports\": { \".\": { \"types\":</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"./src/index.ts\", \"default\": \"./src/index.ts\" } }, \"scripts\": { \"build\": \"tsup\", \"dev\": \"tsup --watch\", \"test\": \"vitest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>run\", \"typecheck\": \"tsc --noEmit\", \"lint\": \"eslint .\" },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{#if hasReact}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"peerDependencies\": { \"react\": \"^18.0.0\" },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{/if}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"devDependencies\": { \"@myorg/tsconfig\": \"workspace:*\", \"@myorg/eslint-config\": \"workspace:*\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{#if hasReact}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"react\": \"^18.3.0\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{/if}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"tsup\": \"^8.0.0\", \"typescript\": \"^5.7.0\", \"vitest\": \"^3.0.0\" } }</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;generate&quot;: &quot;plop&quot;,&#10;    &quot;generate:package&quot;: &quot;plop package&quot;,&#10;    &quot;generate:app&quot;: &quot;plop app&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"generate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"plop\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"generate:package\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"plop package\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"generate:app\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"plop app\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"hygen-模板引擎\">Hygen 模板引擎</h2><p><strong>Hygen</strong> 使用文件系统中的模板目录，无需配置文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"_templates/&#10;├── package/&#10;│   └── new/&#10;│       ├── prompt.js&#10;│       ├── package.json.ejs.t&#10;│       ├── tsconfig.json.ejs.t&#10;│       ├── src/&#10;│       │   └